	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas et priores et posterores acce<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pimus tractantes de iuris-iurandi ratione eoque nomine tibi gratias agimus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>immortales.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Non defuimus officio nostro, omne saxum volvimus et pro concio<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ne et seorsim; non tamen aliud potuimus efficerre, quam quod maior <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>noster senatus decrevit, modo liceat nobis iurare per nomen solius <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>die et transgressores punire, praeeant legati, quibus verbis velint, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>se iuraturos neque ab helvetiis ulla ratione avelli posse aut velle.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Hoc decretum transmiserunt <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName>; sic enim conventum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>etiam per vestros amplissimos legatos, ut primum nostrates decernant, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quid sibi faciundum, idque (sed secreto) transmittant illuc, <placeName ref="l28">Basilense<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>s</placeName> deinde suum decretum nostro adiunctim <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad vos transmittant omnia, quo melior ratio iniri possit, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quid agendum sit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vereor nostros non facile cessuros sententia, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l2">Araugiae</placeName> aliud quiddam per legatos inveniatur, quod magis<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ad tenorem die et patriae incolumitatem facere videatur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Rogandus est nobis dominus, ut dirigat corda ipsorum ad gloriamnominis su<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>i.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Haec raptim; nam plura non potui, cum nuncius ab<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ituriret.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Miratur noster magistratus, quomodo nos, qui sumus a concionibus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sacris, haec rescire potuerimus; secreta enim haec voluerunt <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>esse, Vide, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> mihi charissime, quo in statu sint res <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nostrae.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur nostri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaffusii</placeName> octobris <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>20. anno 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="el" ana="salute"><foreign xml:lang="la">Salutant te</foreign> οἱ συνεργοι μο<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ι.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p3481">Simpertus Vogt</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf...:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An den frommen und wol<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>gelerten meister <persName ref="p495">Hein<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rich Bullinger</persName>, pfarer <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, sinem <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gelieptem herren <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>und bruͦder, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ze überantworten<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
